01:24:52.000 --> 01:24:56.000
Ta ei hirmuta meid.
- Ta saab seda teha.

01:25:02.000 --> 01:25:04.000
Mida sa teed?
- Ma ei vaja sind enam!

01:25:04.000 --> 01:25:09.000
Panid mind uskuma, et olen
väärt seda, mida minu eest maksti.

01:25:09.000 --> 01:25:12.000
Aga Christian armastab mind.

01:25:13.000 --> 01:25:16.000
Ta armastab mind, Harold.

01:25:17.000 --> 01:25:19.000
Ja see on väärt rohkem
kui miski muu.

01:25:19.000 --> 01:25:24.000
Me lahkume sinust, hertsogist
ja Moulin Rouge'ist!

01:25:25.000 --> 01:25:27.000
Hüvasti, Harold.

01:25:27.000 --> 01:25:30.000
Sa oled suremas, Satine.

01:25:34.000 --> 01:25:36.000
Sa oled suremas.

01:25:46.000 --> 01:25:49.000
Veel üks trikk, Harold?
- Ei, mu kallis.

01:25:50.000 --> 01:25:52.000
Arst ütles meile.

01:25:53.000 --> 01:25:55.000
Marie?

01:26:10.000 --> 01:26:12.000
Ma olen suremas.

01:26:18.000 --> 01:26:21.000
Olin narr,

01:26:21.000 --> 01:26:26.000
